### List all parking lots
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parking-lots

### View availability in CITY_CENTER
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parking-lots/CITY_CENTER/spots

### Park a car in CITY_CENTER
POST http://localhost:8080/api/parking-lots/CITY_CENTER/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleNumber": "KA-01-HH-1234",
  "vehicleType": "CAR"
}

### Fetch a ticket (replace {{ticketId}})
GET http://localhost:8080/api/parking-lots/CITY_CENTER/tickets/{{ticketId}}

### Checkout a vehicle (replace {{ticketId}})
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/parking-lots/CITY_CENTER/tickets/{{ticketId}}/checkout
